   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Food Safety Standards for Improved  Competitiveness of SMEs in the Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to provide support and build capacity of agri-food SMEs that handle 80 percent of food consumption and 96 percent of domestic supply chains. These SMEs will be fully and actively involved in the different phases of the project. The project will also benefit from the collaboration with private companies specialized in the development of affordable and adapted cold storage capacity in developing countries. The project will use innovative approaches and cold generation components such as solar energy to design green and environment sensitive cold storage system.</narrative>
  </description>
